---
// PilotCta.astro — extraído de Pilot.astro
---

<!-- ==============================================
     BLOQUE 4: PANEL FINAL OSCURO (CTA Y CONTACTO)
     ============================================== -->
<div id="contacto" class="pilot-cta-section" data-reveal="card">
  <div class="dark-cta-card">
    <!-- Resplandores oscuros ambientales -->
    <div class="dark-glow glow-emerald" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="dark-glow glow-teal" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="dark-cta-content">
      <!-- Pastilla Superior Sobria (Sin promesas de escasez artificial) -->
      <div class="cta-pill-wrap">
        <span class="cta-pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Demostración sin compromiso</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Titular Principal -->
      <h3 class="dark-cta-heading">
        ¿Te gustaría conocer DECA Light para tu empresa?
      </h3>

      <!-- Párrafo Descriptivo -->
      <p class="dark-cta-desc">
        Cuéntanos cómo trabajáis y te enseñamos cómo encaja DECA Light en vuestras instalaciones. Sin ningún tipo de compromiso comercial.
      </p>

      <!-- Botones de Acción -->
      <div class="cta-actions-group">
        <a href="#form-piloto" class="cta-button btn-primary-dark">
          <span>Solicitar demostración</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a href="mailto:contacto@decalight.es?subject=Consulta%20sobre%20DECA%20Light" class="btn-secondary-dark">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="agent-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Hablar directamente con un especialista</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Puntos Clave de Confianza (Sober y veraces) -->
      <div class="cta-checks-row" role="list">
        <div class="check-item" role="listitem">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="check-green" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>Sin compromiso comercial previo</span>
        </div>

        <div class="check-item" role="listitem">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="check-green" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>Acompañamiento técnico presencial o remoto</span>
        </div>

        <div class="check-item" role="listitem">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="check-green" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>Tratamiento confidencial de la información</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cta-button {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  .cta-button::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -120%;
      width: 50%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), transparent);
      transform: skewX(-20deg);
      transition: left 0.65s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  .cta-button:hover::after {
      left: 170%;
    }
  .pilot-cta-section {
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
    }
  .dark-cta-card {
      position: relative;
      background-color: #0E1726;
      border: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-800);
      border-radius: 1.75rem;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      color: var(--palette-white);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .dark-cta-card {
          padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
        }
  }
  .dark-glow {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      filter: blur(80px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  .glow-emerald {
      right: -4rem;
      bottom: -4rem;
      width: 24rem;
      height: 24rem;
      background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.22);
    }
  .glow-teal {
      left: -4rem;
      top: -4rem;
      width: 20rem;
      height: 20rem;
      background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.15);
    }
  .dark-cta-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      max-width: 48rem;
    }
  .cta-pill-wrap {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.3125rem 0.875rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
      color: var(--palette-emerald-300);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  .cta-pulse-dot {
      width: 0.5rem;
      height: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      background-color: var(--palette-emerald-400);
      animation: ping 1.8s cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;
    }
  .dark-cta-heading {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--palette-white);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .dark-cta-heading {
          font-size: 2.25rem;
        }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .dark-cta-heading {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
  }
  .dark-cta-desc {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--palette-slate-300);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 40rem;
    }
  .cta-actions-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cta-actions-group {
          flex-direction: row;
          align-items: center;
        }
  }
  .btn-primary-dark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      color: var(--palette-white);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  .btn-primary-dark:hover {
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-900);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -3px rgba(8, 84, 62, 0.35);
    }
  .btn-primary-dark:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }
  .btn-arrow {
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
  .btn-primary-dark:hover .btn-arrow {
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }
  .btn-secondary-dark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: var(--palette-slate-200);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
  .btn-secondary-dark:hover {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: var(--palette-white);
      border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    }
  .btn-secondary-dark:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }
  .agent-icon {
      color: var(--palette-emerald-400);
    }
  .cta-checks-row {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-800);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--palette-slate-400);
    }
  .check-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  .check-green {
      color: var(--palette-emerald-400);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, ::before, ::after {
          animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
    .badge-amber-pulse,
        .flow-dash-anim,
        .shimmer-active,
        .badge-shimmer::after,
        .ping-circle,
        .cta-pulse-dot,
        .pulse-dot-green {
          animation: none !important;
        }
  }

  @keyframes ping {
      75%, 100% {
        transform: scale(2.2);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
</style>
